comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-25T05:11:42.545Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check evidence: searched all statuses for MCP Apps interactive graph context plan assurance and task views. Existing graph and context owners provide primitives but no standard MCP App presentation layer."
body: "## App portfolio\n\n- Context explorer showing why each item entered the token budget and what was omitted.\n- Relationship graph with typed paths, impact, critical path, communities, redundancy, provenance, and time travel.\n- Plan and milestone view with dependencies, decisions, discoveries, validation, and evidence.\n- Assurance dashboard with measurement provenance, gate verdicts, negative controls, and recurrence families.\n- Long-operation panel for task status, requested input, cancellation, and recovery.\n- Every mutation leaves the app through an explicit SDK-backed MCP tool with preview, consent, authority, and immutable receipt.\n- The app stores presentation state only and can be discarded without losing project state."
